(33, 'goa', 'Goa', 'India', 'India', 'DOMESTIC', NULL, 'Goa is a state in western India with coastlines stretching along the Arabian Sea. Its long history as a Portuguese colony prior to 1961 is evident in its preserved 17th-century churches and the area\'s tropical spice plantations.', 'Baga Beach; Calangute Beach; Dudhsagar Falls', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'assets/images/places/goa.webp', 'https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Baga_Beach,_Goa.jpg', 0, 1),
